## Purpose

This repository contains the source code, designs, assets, and documentation for the official Bianca Diamonds website ([www.biancadiamonds.com](http://www.biancadiamonds.com)).

The code is published on GitHub for transparency, collaboration, portfolio purposes, and contribution by authorized developers. It is **not** open source.

Except where explicitly stated otherwise, all rights are reserved by Bianca Diamonds.

